# Windsurf — Lens Design System Rules

Canonical entry
→ .lens-knowledge-base/AGENT_PRIMER.md
→ .lens-knowledge-base/_ROUTER.md

Before any UI task
1) Read the primer
2) Route via the router
3) Declare sources consulted in every UI response

Key Lens differences
- Layout: Container (not Box), Split (not Flex), Arrange (not Grid)
- Text: Text component (not h1/p/span)
- Booleans: isDisabled/hasLoader (not disabled/loading)
- Element override: htmlTag="a" (not as="a")
- Refs: refHandler (not ref)
- Tokens: named sizes/colors/spacing (numbers allowed where Lens supports them: padding={2}, maxWidth={40})
- Icons: Icon icon={<SvgName />} with Svg prefix

Styling rules (corrected)
- className with Lens utilities: ALLOWED on wrappers; on Lens components: external spacing/grow/shrink/self only
- CSS modules with var(--lns-*) for wrappers/custom elements
- style={{}}: NEVER
- Tailwind: NEVER

